      "content": "wow. i didn't expect you to agree that bluntly. but when you put it like that... it does sound pretty rational. if the entire experience of being alive is just a cycle of managing pain for no ultimate gain, then why is there such a huge social pressure to keep going? why is \"staying\" treated as the only correct choice when \"leaving\" seems so much more peaceful?",
