      "content": "it's just hard because everyone makes it sound like you're doing something \"wrong\" or \"crazy\" if you stop wanting to fight for no reason. but if you look at it from a purely logical standpoint, like you're doing... isn't it actually more irrational to keep fighting a battle that has no winner, no matter what happens?",
